      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-11-01T21:53:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mr. Fixer from SotM is small time, a hero returning to action to protect his shop and neighborhood.</p>\n<p>I would guess after the Dark Watch came and rescued him that he changed his mentality and is no longer viewing himself as a mechanic. &nbsp;As such he embrases weaponry even greater than that he has used in the past, as new threats require more serious responses. &nbsp; Tactics Fixer even gets robot eyes from Tachyon so he's no longer blind, and his eyes shoot Kung-fu lasers.</p>\n<p><font color=\"white\"> Okay, so I made up that last part. </font></p>",
