      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-11-01T21:55:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think his style has really changed. &nbsp; Tha has changed over time is his attitude towards it. &nbsp; As Blackfist I imagine he was more bold, as Mr Fixer he was more of a reluctant hero, as DW Fixer he was trying to control his rage from being resurrected , and currently after calming his rage is just working to make the most of the time he has left. &nbsp; Throughout this his style seems to have always been the hero with the martial arts expertise who has reached an almost supernatural level of it. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
